% F43-BPUSH: DEFECT 43.  BPUSH LET THE 41ST BYTE INTO THE 40-BYTE OUTPUT
% CONVERSION AREA, OVER THE TOP BYTE OF ITS RESET VALUE, AND THE NEXT <#
% FAULTED.  PATCHED, THE 41ST GIVES "STACK OVERFLOW." AND <# STILL WORKS.
DECIMAL
() I_ABORT ABORT !
0 <# 40 ( 35 #PUT ) #> TYPE CR
0 <# 41 ( 35 #PUT ) #> TYPE CR
OCONSTACK 8 + @ OCONSTACK - = CR
0 <# 3 ( 36 #PUT ) #> TYPE CR
12345 = CR
